{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50602","headline":"又句 · 李揆","name":"又句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乡路辕思北，家林巷喜雨。\n以上各句见《四部丛刊》本《唐诗纪事》卷二十八，注云：「出《江邻几杂志》。\n」（《唐诗纪事》卷二十八《李揆》条云：「揆与饶州刺史封渐仲容叔霁连句，揆笔力遒媚。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李揆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50602.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50602","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}